{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy Sheepies is a relaxing sheep farming game that includes some Crafting and Business Management elements with its simple Drag &amp; Drop gameplay. Meet the needs of your sheepies, craft and sell your products, and grow your business! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/1f97794dc03595d293e6d037e4143485.poster.avif?t=1763664005\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/1f97794dc03595d293e6d037e4143485.webm?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/1f97794dc03595d293e6d037e4143485.mp4?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX BY TAKING CARE OF YOUR SHEEPIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheep are your most valuable asset. Harvest crops to feed them! Keep your sheep happy and they will give you milk, wool, and more in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/9189531d1095c36aa77354763d7e7958.poster.avif?t=1763664005\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/9189531d1095c36aa77354763d7e7958.webm?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/9189531d1095c36aa77354763d7e7958.mp4?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT AND SELL YOUR PRODUCTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the most profitable products with your assets then sell them. Invest your profits in your business again by purchasing some automation or new structures to make new recipes like a cheeseburger or leather jackets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/747f8634ef58798440ac6b855893d080.poster.avif?t=1763664005\" width=780 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/747f8634ef58798440ac6b855893d080.webm?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/747f8634ef58798440ac6b855893d080.mp4?t=1763664005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE SHEEPIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 3 days, your happy sheepies will want to make a baby sheepy. More sheepies means more products, more products means more profit! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860450/extras/9ad6a5459d6b6577d79282fd942a7fbc.avif?t=1763664005\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TO BE A PART OF HAPPY SHEEPIES DEVELOPMENT, JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER!</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Basic Controls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2860450/78a30e4c4ab5154cc7a67357ba91f9c1569c9358.jpg"},{"name":"Feed Your Sheepies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2860450/f87a94147bb89b272f35203f3754f64c80eae4c3.jpg"},{"name":"Milking Sheepies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2860450/b37dee2c8